      "created_at": "2014-08-13T21:05:38.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>1. &nbsp;You have to keep it in play. &nbsp;Anything put into play by a power card leaves play when that power card does. &nbsp;Same with Unity's Golems or Ambuscade's hunter or Ra's tornado.</p><p>2. &nbsp;Movement reduction lasts until that player re-rolls movement, and does not affect sprinting or powers that cause you to move.</p>",
